@startuml
!include _style.iuml

title Activity Diagram - Find Suitable Donors

|Blood Seeker|
start
:Open "Find donors";
:Choose the patient's blood group;
:Optionally enter a city and change
"Include compatible groups" /
"Only donors who can donate today";
:Click "Search donors";
|System|
if (Include compatible groups?) then (yes)
  :Groups = every group the patient
  can receive from
  (e.g. A+ gets A+, A-, O+, O-);
else (no)
  :Groups = the patient's own group;
endif
|Database|
:SELECT donors whose blood group
is in the chosen groups;
|System|
if (City entered?) then (yes)
  :Keep donors whose city
  contains the text;
else (no)
endif
if (Only donors who can donate today?) then (yes)
  :Keep donors who are available AND
  last donated at least 90 days ago (men)
  or 120 days ago (women), or never;
else (no)
endif
:Sort: same group first, then
ready today, then by name;
if (Any donors left?) then (yes)
  :Show result cards with status
  and a "Call" button;
  |Blood Seeker|
  :Call a suitable donor;
else (no)
  |System|
  :Show "No matching donors"
  with tips to widen the search;
  |Blood Seeker|
  :Change the filters and search again;
endif
stop
@enduml
